hes of the tile's water layer, source}); occluders {boxes [{xf: 12 floats (instance basis incl. scale + box centre, world), size [x,y,z] in that basis = mesh bounds x geometry.occluder_shrink}] (opaque buildings / rocks >= render.occluder_min_size_m, largest first, max geometry.occluder_max), terrain {res 33, spacing m, heights [res x res, row 0 north] = local minimum - render.occluder_terrain_sink_m, x = origin.x + c x spacing, z = origin.z + r x spacing}}; hlod (null or {file hlod.glb: one mesh, cell-local positions under a root node at the cell origin, NORMAL + COLOR_0 (linear average material colour), one material; HZD coarse LODs of the largest buildings / rocks, triangles <= render.hlod_triangles_per_cell; triangles, instances}); campfires [{id, pos, yaw_deg}]; spawns [{site, orig_type, orig_count [min,max], type, count, pos, radius, rule}] (+ spawns_skipped: unpopulated originals); vegetation = {density: veg_density.dds (BC7 linear, RGBA 512^2, CPU-side data, north up: R trees, G blockbush, B undergrowth, A stealthplants), effect: veg_effect.dds (BC7 linear, value in R, 512^2, north up: HZD ecotope effect 0 = none .. 1 = snow; null when the tile has none), channels: [trees, blockbush, undergrowth, stealthplants], density_scale (hzd_content vegetation.density_scale), species: [{channel, mesh, name, per_m2 (= density_scale x hzd_per_m2, instances per m2 at channel density 1), hzd_per_m2, expected (instances in this cell = per_m2 x sum of channel density x effect_range), max_instances (min(expected, vegetation.max_instances_per_species): cap per species and cell), cluster {count, radius_m} (design: instances per scatter point and spread), footprint_m, wander_m, scale, scale_variance, max_slope_deg, effect_range? [lo, hi] (place only where veg_effect is within; snow / frost / no-snow variants)}]}. All images are DDS: 'DDS ' + DDS_HEADER (flags CAPS|HEIGHT|WIDTH|PIXELFORMAT|MIPMAPCOUNT|LINEARSIZE, FourCC DX10, caps TEXTURE|MIPMAP|COMPLEX) + DDS_HEADER_DXT10 (dxgiFormat, TEXTURE2D, arraySize 1), full mip chain to 1x1; DXGI 71/72 BC1, 77/78 BC3, 83 BC5, 98/99 BC7 (sRGB variants: 72, 78, 99)"}
const CACHE_MESHES := {"id": "cache.meshes", "game": "cache", "kind": "file-format", "alias": "-", "path_or_pattern": "hzd/meshes/<meshid>.glb", "owner": "svet", "consumer": "game instances", "notes": "meshid = 16 hex of the archive path hash of the mesh's core file + _<object index in that file>; static glb in Godot axes, mesh-local (the instance xf places it); asset.extras {source, lod, lods, format (4)}; meshes of an older format are exported again under the same id; textures are shared DDS files hzd/textures/<texid>.dds referenced by image uri ../textures/<texid>.dds (mimeType image/vnd-ms.dds): baseColorTexture BC1 sRGB, or BC7 sRGB when the texture set has a cut-out mask (alpha coverage kept in the mips; material alphaMode MASK, alphaCutoff 0.5, doubleSided); normalTexture BC5 linear (tangent space X = R, Y = G, +Y up like glTF, Z rebuilt); occlusionTexture = metallicRoughnessTexture = one ORM BC1 linear (R occlusion, G roughness, B metallic 0; factors 1); cell.json textures lists them; GC must keep textures referenced by any remaining cell; sidecars <meshid>.tex (texture ids + #colorized flag) and <meshid>.empty (no drawable geometry) are converter bookkeeping"}
